From: Daniel Martin <dmanlfc@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] phy: qcom: qmp-combo: outlast the dwc3 role-switch reset

A PD data role swap and the DP alt mode entry land together, so the
typec mux re-inits the USB PHY while dwc3 holds its core in reset for
100 ms and PCS never reports ready within 10 ms.

---
--- a/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c
+++ b/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c
@@ -71,7 +71,8 @@
 #define SW_PORTSELECT_MUX			BIT(1)
 #define INVERT_CC_POLARITY			BIT(2)
 
-#define PHY_INIT_COMPLETE_TIMEOUT		10000
+/* covers the 100 ms dwc3 holds its core in reset on a role switch */
+#define PHY_INIT_COMPLETE_TIMEOUT		200000
 
 enum qmpphy_mode {
 	QMPPHY_MODE_USB3DP = 0,
